f outfits and personalize your own guided missile.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf10 PLAY WITH FRIENDS AND OTHER PLAYERS ONLINE</strong></h2>Complete the story mode with other players, chat with them, and trade items.<br><strong>It's even more fun with friends!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/3eae026fc97e55ee8cfe502ac013d677.poster.avif?t=1754321184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/3eae026fc97e55ee8cfe502ac013d677.webm?t=1754321184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/3eae026fc97e55ee8cfe502ac013d677.mp4?t=1754321184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae REPLAYABILITY!</strong></h2>DEPO's postgame content is extensive and packed with new adventures, offering hours and hours of entertainment even after you complete the main story! It's almost like getting a new game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u23f1\ufe0f TIME TRIAL MODE</strong></h2>Each file in DEPO has a time trial mode where you can race against Bill, the fastest pixel in the System. Train and find hundreds of shortcuts to achieve incredible speeds.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/8b2908a6741c752ff9190ad4f346728e.poster.avif?t=1754321184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/8b2908a6741c752ff9190ad4f346728e.webm?t=1754321184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/8b2908a6741c752ff9190ad4f346728e.mp4?t=1754321184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u26bd MULTIPLAYER MINIGAMES</strong></h2>As if the story mode wasn't enough, you'll also find 5 frantic multiplayer minigames where your friendships will be put to the test...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f LEVEL EDITOR</strong></h2>You can also create your own levels and share them with the community. Let your creativity run wild.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/3bb0c9b35abc343bcfa9a62e88682e1d.poster.avif?t=1754321184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/3bb0c9b35abc343bcfa9a62e88682e1d.webm?t=1754321184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/3bb0c9b35abc343bcfa9a62e88682e1d.mp4?t=1754321184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Join the DEPO community on Discord by clicking in the social networks on the right \ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffc</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091320/extras/298b85644618eea74770be2b539fb9a2.avif?t=1754321184\" /></div>",
